	"data": "Room 2.0 Architecture — Core and Sub-Apps\n\nType: Architecture Concept\nStatus: Evolving — first specs being written now\nOrigin: MyRoom2.0 capstone (2022) → evolving into spec-driven architecture (2026)\n\nCore Idea\nRoom 2.0 is a spatial computing environment that digitizes your room experience as a complete alternative to using a PC with monitors. It has a core set of systems (XR Slider, room scanning, window/portal management, avatar system, multiplayer) and sub-apps that plug into the core…",
